    <item>
      <title>1.1.3</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Fixed</h3><ul><li>The Design page no longer overlaps itself in a small window. Below about 850 points of height the sidebar's first heading sat behind the traffic lights, the inspector's tab picker slid under the toolbar where the Apply button covered it, and the auto-apply switch fell off the bottom edge.</li><li>The design inspector's three tabs are translated. They read "Style / Typography / Background" in every language, including the Turkish build.</li></ul>]]></description>
