    <item>
      <title>1.1.2</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Fixed</h3><ul><li>iCloud sync works. It never did in a released build: the CloudKit schema had only ever been deployed to the development environment, so every signed copy of KindleWall failed silently against production. Nothing you had was lost — nothing had been reaching the cloud to lose.</li><li>Sync recovers when the record zone goes missing instead of failing forever. The &quot;zone already created&quot; mark lived only on your Mac, so once the server no longer had the zone, the app stopped trying.</li></ul>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 14:42:08 +0300</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
