    <item>
      <title>1.1.1</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Fixed</h3><ul><li>A failed sync no longer forgets what it owed. A push that errored dropped its pending work, so a deleted quote could disappear locally and stay in the cloud with nothing left to retry the deletion.</li><li>Pulling no longer discards local changes that have not been sent yet.</li><li>Sync failures are reported instead of being swallowed. An unreachable record zone used to be indistinguishable from an empty one, which is how the problem above stayed invisible.</li></ul>]]></description>
